    kind: work_item  # 55bf
    title: "c: name-only resolution binds first-party calls to a vendored platform shim -- fluent-bit resolves 116 of 162 sendto/recv sites into a NuttX compatibility file, so none reaches the catalogue"  # 55bf
    status: todo_hard  # 55bf
    priority: 3  # 55bf
    parent:  # 55bf
    tags:  # 55bf
